#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:2
msgid "Business hosting"
msgstr "Business 托管"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"We offer |com_brand| for building and hosting documentation for private "
"repositories."
msgstr "我们提供 |com_brand|，用于构建和托管私有仓库的文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"In order to get started quickly, you can start a `free 30-day trial "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ to test out the platform."
msgstr "为快速上手，你可以先 `免费试用 30 天 <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ 体验平台。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"During the trial period, your documentation is served with a ``noindex`` "
"robots directive, so search engines won't index it. Subscribe to a paid plan"
" to make your documentation indexable."
msgstr "试用期内，你的文档会带上 ``noindex`` robots 指令提供服务，搜索引擎不会索引它。订阅付费套餐后文档才可被索引。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:20
msgid "`Read the Docs features <https://about.readthedocs.com/features/>`__"
msgstr "`Read the Docs features <https://about.readthedocs.com/features/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"A high-level overview of platform features, and the `pricing page "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ has a feature breakdown by "
"subscription level."
msgstr ""
"平台功能高层概览，以及按订阅等级列出的 `pricing page "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ 功能明细。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:25
msgid "Commercial documentation solutions"
msgstr "商业文档解决方案"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"In addition to providing the same features as |org_brand|, commercial "
"subscriptions to Read the Docs add additional features and run on separate "
"infrastructure."
msgstr "除提供与 |org_brand| 相同的功能外，Read the Docs 的商业订阅还增加额外功能，并运行在独立的基础设施上。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:30
msgid ""
"The following list is a high-level overview of the areas covered by "
"|com_brand|. If you want a full feature breakdown, please refer to our "
"`pricing page <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下列表高层概述了 |com_brand| 覆盖的领域。若需完整功能明细，请参阅我们的 `pricing page "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:33
msgid "Private repositories and private documentation"
msgstr "私有仓库与私有文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"The largest difference between the community solution and our commercial "
"offering is the ability to connect to private repositories, to restrict "
"documentation access to certain users, or to share private documentation via"
" private hyperlinks."
msgstr "社区方案与商业方案的最大差异在于：可连接私有仓库、可将文档访问权限限制给特定用户，或通过私有超链接分享私有文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:39
msgid "Priority support"
msgstr "优先支持"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"We have a dedicated support team that responds to support requests during "
"business hours."
msgstr "我们设有专门的支持团队，在工作时间响应支持请求。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:42
msgid "Advertising-free"
msgstr "无广告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:43
msgid "All commercially hosted documentation is always ad-free."
msgstr "所有商业托管的文档始终无广告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:45
msgid "Business features"
msgstr "Business 功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/index.rst:46
msgid ""
"Enjoy additional functionality specifically for larger organizations such as"
" team management, single sign-on, and audit logging."
msgstr "享受专为大型组织打造的额外功能，如团队管理、单点登录和审计日志。"

